 ## Background
-This method originates from the voxel wiki's discussion on palette compression, specifically addressing the implementation of packed storage for voxel chunks [S1]. It builds on the concept of palettes in computing, where a small set of colors or types is mapped to indices [S1]. The technique is inspired by similar optimizations in games like Minecraft JE 1.13: The Flattening, which reduced the number of block types [S1]. The original article was published on longor.net [S1].
